WEBVTT

00:00:20.350 --> 00:00:21.330
Claudio...

00:00:21.820 --> 00:00:23.290
Think you could take off...

00:00:28.750 --> 00:00:30.450
your glasses for me?

00:00:31.860 --> 00:00:33.500
Sorry to keep you waiting.

00:00:33.910 --> 00:00:36.400
Here is tonight's dolce.

00:00:40.420 --> 00:00:43.200
How did you know that today was my birthday?

00:00:44.010 --> 00:00:48.190
I heard it from a customer here, one year ago today.

00:00:49.520 --> 00:00:51.910
I remember it was raining that night.

00:00:52.360 --> 00:00:55.420
You were with some close friends, Madam.

00:00:55.420 --> 00:00:57.050
You remembered that?

00:00:57.980 --> 00:01:00.080
I'm glad it's not raining this year.

00:01:00.550 --> 00:01:03.370
Happy birthday.

00:01:06.230 --> 00:01:07.310
Thank you.

00:01:07.950 --> 00:01:11.760
Another year has come and gone, it seems.

00:01:12.300 --> 00:01:15.580
Indeed it has. You're welcome to stop by anytime.

00:01:17.440 --> 00:01:23.300
<i>This mysterious restaurant is on a road just a little ways from the center of Rome.</i>

00:03:06.220 --> 00:03:11.560
Nicoletta

00:03:22.280 --> 00:03:24.480
Oh, if that's the place you're looking for,

00:03:24.480 --> 00:03:27.930
just take a left at that corner and it's right up the street.

00:03:27.930 --> 00:03:29.280
Grazie.

00:03:29.280 --> 00:03:30.710
Do you have a reservation?

00:03:31.220 --> 00:03:35.030
It's a popular spot, so you probably won't get seated without one.

00:03:35.510 --> 00:03:36.310
Good luck.

00:03:39.200 --> 00:03:40.840
It's really that popular?

00:03:57.960 --> 00:04:01.060
Ristorante casetta dell'orso...

00:04:02.760 --> 00:04:03.800
This is it.

00:04:17.450 --> 00:04:18.510
Buonasera.

00:04:19.930 --> 00:04:21.070
Buonasera.

00:04:26.240 --> 00:04:27.870
Do you have a reservation?

00:04:29.290 --> 00:04:31.280
No, I don't.

00:04:32.080 --> 00:04:36.380
I'm afraid we're entirely booked tonight...

00:04:36.380 --> 00:04:37.200
Umm...

00:04:40.500 --> 00:04:42.300
Is the owner in?

00:04:42.800 --> 00:04:44.560
He should be here any minute.

00:04:45.010 --> 00:04:47.720
Forgive me, but who might you be?

00:04:47.720 --> 00:04:50.880
Well... I'm the daughter of an acquaintance of his!

00:04:52.620 --> 00:04:55.790
In that case, please have a seat and wait over here.

00:04:56.430 --> 00:04:57.390
Grazie.

00:05:00.700 --> 00:05:02.570
Allow me to take your coat.

00:05:04.200 --> 00:05:05.330
Excuse me.

00:05:08.320 --> 00:05:09.180
Grazie.

00:05:10.080 --> 00:05:11.820
Is this your first time in Rome?

00:05:12.740 --> 00:05:14.760
My first since I was a little girl.

00:05:14.760 --> 00:05:16.130
I was actually born here.

00:05:18.120 --> 00:05:19.480
Fantastic.

00:05:29.050 --> 00:05:31.100
<i>I really came here.</i>

00:05:40.530 --> 00:05:41.240
For you.

00:05:42.050 --> 00:05:44.440
<i>My, he looks so kind.</i>

00:05:46.870 --> 00:05:47.790
Grazie.

00:05:53.440 --> 00:05:56.730
<i>They're all older men with spectacles...</i>

00:05:57.350 --> 00:05:59.000
<i>What kind of restaurant is this?</i>

00:06:00.870 --> 00:06:02.030
Owner!

00:06:05.300 --> 00:06:08.300
You have a guest waiting for you.

00:06:08.300 --> 00:06:09.100
Oh?

00:06:11.040 --> 00:06:11.950
Who might it be?

00:06:21.570 --> 00:06:23.390
What the hell are you doing here?!

00:06:23.880 --> 00:06:27.150
I have something to tell the owner - your husband.

00:06:28.150 --> 00:06:33.450
About the fact you're really a divorcee with a twenty-one year old daughter.

00:06:33.450 --> 00:06:35.940
Oh no, you don't! No way!

00:06:35.940 --> 00:06:38.020
I could care less what you think.

00:06:38.620 --> 00:06:41.150
Listen to what your mother says!

00:06:41.150 --> 00:06:43.680
I've never once thought of you as my mother!

00:06:46.320 --> 00:06:49.510
Fine. Then you aren't my daughter.

00:06:54.210 --> 00:06:58.520
How about you take this conversation inside? You two must be cold out here.

00:06:58.520 --> 00:07:00.020
Be right in!

00:07:00.020 --> 00:07:00.500
OK.

00:07:04.360 --> 00:07:10.560
Look, just leave me alone tonight. We'll talk this over tomorrow, OK?

00:07:10.560 --> 00:07:11.430
OK?

00:07:15.370 --> 00:07:18.220
<i>I've really never considered her my mother.</i>

00:07:18.960 --> 00:07:23.530
<i>She got divorced from my father fifteen years ago and left.</i>

00:07:25.230 --> 00:07:28.270
<i>She left me at my grandmother's.</i>

00:07:28.590 --> 00:07:32.990
Look, Mommy really wants to get married to someone,

00:07:33.910 --> 00:07:37.630
but he told me he won't get married to someone who's been divorced.

00:07:39.160 --> 00:07:40.480
So you understand, right?

00:07:40.480 --> 00:07:41.730
But...

00:07:41.980 --> 00:07:43.790
I'll come back to see you.

00:07:48.020 --> 00:07:48.750
Ciao.

00:07:54.500 --> 00:07:58.300
<i>I can literally count the number of times she actually came to see me.</i>

00:07:59.020 --> 00:08:01.910
<i>I grew up without ever saying a word about it,</i>

00:08:02.390 --> 00:08:05.110
<i>but I've run out of patience.</i>

00:08:05.110 --> 00:08:06.990
<i>I'm gonna tell him tonight.</i>

00:08:08.590 --> 00:08:11.030
What's the matter, Nicoletta?

00:08:11.030 --> 00:08:12.710
You're quieter than usual tonight.

00:08:13.110 --> 00:08:17.470
Oh, this is that 1994 I ordered last month...

00:08:17.470 --> 00:08:18.000
Guess again.

00:08:20.270 --> 00:08:22.480
<i>He seems a little strange.</i>

00:08:22.910 --> 00:08:25.770
So, how do you two know each other?

00:08:25.980 --> 00:08:28.180
Umm, the truth is...

00:08:28.180 --> 00:08:30.570
She's Nicoletta, the daughter of a friend of mine!

00:08:30.570 --> 00:08:32.560
She's on vacation here in Rome.

00:08:32.560 --> 00:08:33.130
Huh?

00:08:33.130 --> 00:08:36.160
I'm gonna take good care of her while she's in town!

00:08:43.860 --> 00:08:45.310
Thank you.

00:08:45.310 --> 00:08:47.250
My mother would be so happy!

00:08:49.850 --> 00:08:51.290
Excuse me.

00:08:54.010 --> 00:08:55.640
<i>This is the man from before...</i>

00:08:55.640 --> 00:08:59.000
Yes, this is our head cameriere, Claudio.

00:08:59.850 --> 00:09:01.630
This is Nicoletta.

00:09:02.140 --> 00:09:04.050
She's the daughter of one of Olga's friends.

00:09:04.610 --> 00:09:07.210
Seems she's sightseeing here in Rome.

00:09:07.210 --> 00:09:11.030
I see. So that's how you know each other.

00:09:11.030 --> 00:09:12.360
Th-That's right.

00:09:13.300 --> 00:09:16.550
This is tonight's antipasto.

00:09:22.490 --> 00:09:24.410
<i>He's so graceful in his work.</i>

00:09:26.330 --> 00:09:28.550
Please take your time to savor it.

00:09:30.800 --> 00:09:33.250
<i>I see. He's a real gentleman.</i>

00:09:36.260 --> 00:09:37.010
<i>What?</i>

00:09:38.420 --> 00:09:40.450
<i>What kind of restaurant is this?</i>

00:09:41.560 --> 00:09:43.660
<i>Everyone's got googly-eyes.</i>

00:09:46.880 --> 00:09:47.940
This is delicious!

00:09:47.940 --> 00:09:51.260
Yes, our chef is quite talented.

00:09:52.000 --> 00:09:53.970
No wonder it's popular.

00:09:53.970 --> 00:09:57.270
When I walked in, they told me I'd need a reservation.

00:09:57.270 --> 00:10:02.280
Yes, most of our customers come to pursue the waitstaff.

00:10:02.280 --> 00:10:02.930
Huh?

00:10:03.950 --> 00:10:06.700
We get bombarded with women infatuated with real gentlemen.

00:10:06.700 --> 00:10:08.570
It's like this every single night.

00:10:12.770 --> 00:10:14.730
<i>It's like a different world to me.</i>

00:10:17.050 --> 00:10:18.120
Excuse me for a moment.

00:10:19.270 --> 00:10:22.870
We have a customer who doesn't eat beef,

00:10:22.870 --> 00:10:26.260
so please prepare one portion of the antipasto accordingly.

00:10:26.260 --> 00:10:27.370
Understood.

00:10:29.500 --> 00:10:33.250
Miss, the restroom is the door to your right.

00:10:33.250 --> 00:10:33.970
Thank you.

00:10:36.280 --> 00:10:39.070
Oh, this is our chef.

00:10:41.370 --> 00:10:44.330
The antipasto was fantastic.

00:10:44.820 --> 00:10:46.210
Thank you very much.

00:10:47.980 --> 00:10:49.520
Another pair of spectacles...

00:10:50.890 --> 00:10:55.060
Spectacles must be required wear here, huh?

00:10:58.840 --> 00:11:01.160
I suppose you could say that.

00:11:01.810 --> 00:11:05.350
You won't be hired here if you don't wear them.

00:11:05.350 --> 00:11:06.220
Huh?

00:11:06.220 --> 00:11:08.300
My vision is fine, actually.

00:11:08.770 --> 00:11:10.020
See?

00:11:09.350 --> 00:11:10.580
Wh-What?

00:11:10.580 --> 00:11:12.000
They're just for show.

00:11:12.000 --> 00:11:13.100
Why?

00:11:13.860 --> 00:11:16.110
Madam prefers it that way.

00:11:13.860 --> 00:11:16.110
Madam prefers it that way.

00:11:17.230 --> 00:11:19.490
<i>Pr-Prefers it?</i>

00:11:21.530 --> 00:11:24.450
<i>What kind of restaurant is this?</i>

00:11:43.050 --> 00:11:44.990
Man, she really pisses me off.

00:11:48.860 --> 00:11:51.520
Having all that fun living here...

00:11:56.320 --> 00:11:57.110
Hello?

00:11:57.110 --> 00:11:59.290
Nicoletta? It's me.

00:11:59.290 --> 00:12:03.210
I know I promised we'd talk today, but something came up and I can't make it.

00:12:03.210 --> 00:12:06.660
I'll call you when I finish setting you up with the apartment today.

00:12:03.330 --> 00:12:04.110
Huh?

00:12:06.660 --> 00:12:07.190
Ciao!

00:12:07.850 --> 00:12:08.910
Hey!

00:12:09.910 --> 00:12:12.100
All she thinks about is herself!

00:12:38.880 --> 00:12:41.590
<i>I'm lucky that she'll loan me an apartment...</i>

00:12:42.590 --> 00:12:43.970
<i>But what should I do here?</i>

00:12:57.470 --> 00:12:58.010
<i>Huh?</i>

00:12:58.700 --> 00:13:00.840
<i>Isn't that the head cameriere?</i>

00:13:05.470 --> 00:13:06.170
Ciao.

00:13:07.280 --> 00:13:08.550
Buon giorno.

00:13:09.010 --> 00:13:11.490
Buon giorno, Nicoletta.

00:13:11.490 --> 00:13:12.750
Out for a stroll?

00:13:14.440 --> 00:13:15.840
<i>He's kinda sexy.</i>

00:13:19.230 --> 00:13:23.690
If I had time, I'd love to show you around town a bit.

00:13:24.260 --> 00:13:27.510
Unfortunately, I have to get to the restaurant already...

00:13:27.510 --> 00:13:32.040
Oh, if you haven't eaten yet, why don't you come with me?

00:13:32.470 --> 00:13:34.630
But I don't have a reservation.

00:13:34.630 --> 00:13:37.330
You can have some of the food they give the staff.

00:13:37.830 --> 00:13:41.200
It's actually about as good as the stuff on the menu.

00:13:42.410 --> 00:13:46.380
Oh, perhaps it was rude of me to invite you like that.

00:13:49.180 --> 00:13:51.000
Not at all. I want to go.

00:13:52.270 --> 00:13:57.290
The owner asked me to show you a good time while you're here in Rome.

00:14:00.300 --> 00:14:04.750
Just what did the owner see in her that made him want to marry her?

00:14:05.310 --> 00:14:07.630
Wanting to be surrounded by bespectacled men...

00:14:07.630 --> 00:14:09.040
Always pushing her selfish demands...

00:14:10.740 --> 00:14:14.610
I understand the owner's feelings quite well.

00:14:15.330 --> 00:14:17.760
He wants to make her happy.

00:14:18.250 --> 00:14:20.630
She's a lovely lady.

00:14:22.660 --> 00:14:23.580
<i>Eh.</i>

00:14:23.580 --> 00:14:25.500
<i>Why did I say "Eh"?</i>

00:14:29.220 --> 00:14:30.480
Are you all right?

00:14:31.690 --> 00:14:33.980
This is a bustling town.

00:14:34.900 --> 00:14:40.020
But try and fall in love with Rome as much as you can.

00:14:44.030 --> 00:14:44.690
OK.

00:15:16.700 --> 00:15:18.230
Sorry to keep you waiting.

00:15:19.430 --> 00:15:20.020
Huh?

00:15:20.720 --> 00:15:25.480
Please, allow me to introduce you to everyone again.

00:15:31.120 --> 00:15:32.210
<i>This is dangerous...</i>

00:15:37.910 --> 00:15:39.180
Grazie.

00:15:39.180 --> 00:15:40.200
Prego.

00:15:51.050 --> 00:15:54.440
Say, who's the most popular among you guys?

00:15:57.130 --> 00:15:58.720
Well, that's gotta be Luciano.

00:15:58.720 --> 00:16:00.040
I'd say Vito.

00:16:01.730 --> 00:16:07.650
No, Teo has all the women waiting with bated breath for him to come out of the kitchen.

00:16:07.650 --> 00:16:10.130
Well, I'm gonna have to say Furio.

00:16:11.230 --> 00:16:14.260
Oh, I'm disqualified for wearing fake spectacles.

00:16:19.200 --> 00:16:21.000
How about you, Claudio?

00:16:21.860 --> 00:16:23.500
Me?

00:16:23.720 --> 00:16:27.210
All the first-time customers like him.

00:16:28.040 --> 00:16:31.320
But there are others who are more popular with the regulars.

00:16:31.850 --> 00:16:34.860
That's not to say he isn't popular with them, too.

00:16:34.860 --> 00:16:36.220
Why's that?

00:16:36.220 --> 00:16:39.220
Because he's serious, he keeps his urges to himself,

00:16:39.690 --> 00:16:41.210
and... look.

00:16:45.560 --> 00:16:48.490
Vito and Furio are wearing rings too,

00:16:48.490 --> 00:16:51.500
but they don't act as serious about it as Claudio does.

00:16:51.980 --> 00:16:55.650
How can I say no to a beautiful woman?

00:16:56.540 --> 00:17:00.550
And Furio gives cooking lessons to women.

00:17:00.970 --> 00:17:03.340
At home, on days when the restaurant is closed.

00:17:03.870 --> 00:17:05.580
It's nothing special, really.

00:17:06.410 --> 00:17:07.440
That's wonderful.

00:17:07.880 --> 00:17:10.410
Luciano is a widower.

00:17:10.410 --> 00:17:11.950
He's always got a sour expression,

00:17:11.950 --> 00:17:14.820
but there are some women who can't get enough of that.

00:17:16.350 --> 00:17:19.570
Lunch today is a little too salty.

00:17:19.570 --> 00:17:21.600
Which one of you bums made this?

00:17:21.600 --> 00:17:27.060
See. All that complaining is aging you quickly.

00:17:28.300 --> 00:17:31.990
So you see, we're all unique.

00:17:31.990 --> 00:17:37.470
Though we didn't get popular until word got out about all the spectacles.

00:17:46.430 --> 00:17:48.760
Umm, what about Gigi?

00:17:48.760 --> 00:17:51.350
Oh, Gigi doesn't socialize much.

00:17:51.350 --> 00:17:53.440
No, he doesn't.

00:17:53.440 --> 00:17:54.090
Nope.

00:17:54.860 --> 00:17:56.390
Not at all.

00:17:56.390 --> 00:17:58.090
Now that's not true.

00:18:04.190 --> 00:18:08.750
Well, I was a bit uncomfortable with how we attract so many strange customers...

00:18:09.200 --> 00:18:11.420
But we got over that quickly.

00:18:11.420 --> 00:18:14.110
And of course, we have people who come for the food, too.

00:18:14.110 --> 00:18:16.260
They come for Teo's dolce, that's for sure.

00:18:16.260 --> 00:18:17.860
You're too kind.

00:18:27.080 --> 00:18:29.430
<i>It's just whatever furniture was lying around,</i>

00:18:29.430 --> 00:18:30.960
<i>so let me know if there's anything else you need.</i>

00:18:44.140 --> 00:18:46.060
<i>Oh, that's right, her...</i>

00:18:47.390 --> 00:18:50.000
<i>Every birthday, when I was a little girl...</i>

00:18:50.910 --> 00:18:53.040
<i>Grazie, Mama.</i>

00:19:02.040 --> 00:19:05.470
Well, there's nothing wrong with being sent gifts.

00:19:12.140 --> 00:19:14.970
Welcome to Rome - Olga.

00:19:31.150 --> 00:19:33.300
Buonasera, Rome.

00:19:35.340 --> 00:19:37.450
Is she going to be all right all alone?

00:19:38.110 --> 00:19:41.180
She can stay with us as often as she wants.

00:19:41.180 --> 00:19:44.630
Thanks, but don't worry.

00:19:44.630 --> 00:19:45.670
She'll be fine.

00:19:50.000 --> 00:19:51.080
You're cold.

00:19:51.820 --> 00:19:53.620
Let's go warm up at the restaurant.

00:19:54.400 --> 00:19:57.050
I wonder if everyone will be wearing glasses again today.

00:20:04.710 --> 00:20:06.320
Oh, you again?

00:20:07.050 --> 00:20:08.880
Nice greeting.

00:20:08.880 --> 00:20:12.010
Oh, things just prettied up around here.

00:20:15.900 --> 00:20:19.190
Sheesh, this isn't a playground for kids.

00:20:18.100 --> 00:20:21.150
<i>I have to say, I'm starting to like this place, too.</i>

00:20:19.190 --> 00:20:24.400
I don't care if you're friends with the Madam. Kids these days, I swear...

00:20:21.550 --> 00:20:23.990
<i>Though I haven't developed a spectacles-fetish yet.</i>

00:20:24.400 --> 00:20:26.300
<i>I'm different from those other women.</i>

00:20:27.670 --> 00:20:28.450
<i>But...</i>

00:20:31.540 --> 00:20:34.390
<i>I really like that one gentleman.</i>

00:20:38.830 --> 00:20:41.930
The restaurant is located on a street in Rome.

00:20:42.330 --> 00:20:44.970
Its name is casetta dell'orso.

00:20:45.680 --> 00:20:48.300
It means "a bear's tiny house."

00:20:49.130 --> 00:20:51.690
Was that her idea, too?

00:20:56.960 --> 00:21:15.450
Ring

00:21:09.610 --> 00:21:10.940
I mustn't!

00:22:57.500 --> 00:23:04.430
I mustn't ...miss the next episode!
